41", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/e2690f27/uploads/origins/d034535e-ea7d-438f-9b50-965630f25b1b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=06e16938b541ed5809daf8a4770fcbc2", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/e2690f27/uploads/origins/d034535e-ea7d-438f-9b50-965630f25b1b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=06e16938b541ed5809daf8a4770fcbc2, https://si.imgix.net/e2690f27/uploads/origins/d034535e-ea7d-438f-9b50-965630f25b1b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=117c8997cb5dc0e54fab25edde4fb972 2x, https://si.imgix.net/e2690f27/uploads/origins/d034535e-ea7d-438f-9b50-965630f25b1b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4e59963656185754a594f48d9a8d09d9 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": true, "body": "まるぱのイラストをお願いします。\nまるぱとは艦これのパースが「ぱ」の文字を付けた白スク水を着たものです。\nポーズはおまかせします。\nよろしくお願いします。\nhttps://i.imgur.com/6PCDRPt.jpeg\n\nhttps://i.imgur.com/6PCDRPt.jpeg", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@Sohuzi/works/40", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/ffc349fc/uploads/origins/52a58475-1da0-4b28-bccc-63206eae21d9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e2d28e0f824a0af2d55b8654b5bfa16e", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/ffc349fc/uploads/origins/52a58475-1da0-4b28-bccc-63206eae21d9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e2d28e0f824a0af2d55b8654b5bfa16e, https://si.imgix.net/ffc349fc/uploads/origins/52a58475-1da0-4b28-bccc-63206eae21d9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=dc001fbda52bd642fa25c5b22deb01b4 2x, https://si.imgix.net/ffc349fc/uploads/origins/52a58475-1da0-4b28-bccc-63206eae21d9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e8df2ad1b73eeaf86b6efd55a7b57f68 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "skebで描かれていたサクラチヨノオーが素晴らしかったので、私も依頼させていただきます。\n\nキャラクター:ウ